# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# type:
#   feat      - new feature
#   fix       - bug fix
#   refactor  - code refactor (no behavior change)
#   perf      - performance improvement
#   style     - formatting, naming, comments (no logic change)
#   test      - tests
#   docs      - documentation
#   build     - build system / toolchain
#   ci        - CI configuration
#   chore     - maintenance / misc
#
# scope:
#   Optional. Module or subsystem name, e.g. mem, sched, arch(x86), tool(codegen)
#
# subject:
#   - imperative mood (e.g. "add", "fix", "remove")
#   - no trailing period
#   - <= 72 characters
#
# body:
#   - explain WHY, not HOW
#   - <= 256 characters
#
# footer:
#   - Fixes: #issue
#   - BREAKING CHANGE: description
#   - <= 256 characters
